**Summary:** No PR. BUG-1171 / B-050 needs no CE_SHARED change. The plan is a Manager-only fix in `Modules/Manager/Services/CeAdminStorageService.cs` and `CeOneGlanceStatus.cs`:
- send only the short list;
- move unsent files to "kept, not sent" instead of deleting them;
- stop the one-time move from taking Civil's outbox.

It's guarded by a new switch, `pluginOutboxFullRecords`, which is off by default so the fix is on; switching it on brings back today's behaviour. `drainPluginOutbox` stays off until Tim answers Q1.
